[{"id":"fm-core1-1.50-q1","number":1,"question":"<p>Simplify each of the following:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"2\\times2^k\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"-3\\times3^k\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\\times a^k\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"2\\times2^k=2^{k+1}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"-3\\times3^k=-3^{k+1}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"a\\times a^k=a^{k+1}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.50-q2","number":2,"question":"<p>Simplify each of the following:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(1+a)\\times(1+a)^k\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(1-a)\\times(1-a)^k\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"(1+a)\\times(1+a)^k=(1+a)^{k+1}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"(1-a)\\times(1-a)^k=(1-a)^{k+1}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.50-q3","number":3,"question":"<p>Simplify each of the following:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"3\\times2!\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"12\\times11!\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(k+1)k!\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"3\\times2!=3!=6.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"12\\times11!=12!.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"(k+1)k!=(k+1)!.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.50-q4","number":4,"question":"<p>Use proof by induction to show that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"2^n&gt;2n\" data-display=\"false\"></span> for all positive integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\" data-display=\"false\"></span> such that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\ge3\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","steps":["<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=3\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"2^3=8\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"2\\times3=6\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and since <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"8\\ge6\" data-display=\"false\"></span> so true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=3\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Assume true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"2^k&gt;2k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"2^{k+1}=2\\times2^k.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>So since <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"2^k&gt;2k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"2^{k+1}&gt;2\\times2k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"2^{k+1}&gt;4k=2k+2k.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Since <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\\ge3\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, we know that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"2k\\ge6\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"2^{k+1}&gt;2k+6&gt;2k+2=2(k+1),\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>which is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"2^n&gt;2n\" data-display=\"false\"></span> with <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> substituted in.</p>","<p>As the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=3\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, and if the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> then the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so the statement is true for all integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\ge3\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.50-q5","number":5,"question":"<p>Use mathematical induction to prove that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"4^n&gt;3n+7\" data-display=\"false\"></span> for all integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\ge2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","steps":["<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"4^2=16\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"3\\times2+7=13\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and since <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"16&gt;13\" data-display=\"false\"></span> so true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Assume true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"4^k&gt;3k+7\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"4^{k+1}=4\\times4^k.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>So since <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"4^k&gt;3k+7\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, then <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"4\\times4^k&gt;4(3k+7)=12k+28\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. As <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\\ge2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"12k+28&gt;3k+10\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"4^{k+1}&gt;3k+10=3k+3+7=3(k+1)+7,\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>which is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"4^n&gt;3n+7\" data-display=\"false\"></span> with <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> substituted in.</p>","<p>As the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, and if the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> then the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so the statement is true for all integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\ge2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.50-q6","number":6,"question":"<p>Prove by induction, for all integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\ge5\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n^2&lt;2^n\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","steps":["<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=5\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"5^2=25\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"2^5=32\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and since <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"25&lt;32\" data-display=\"false\"></span> true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=5\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Assume true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k^2&lt;2^k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"2k^2&lt;2\\times2^k,\\qquad 2k^2&lt;2^{k+1},\\qquad k^2+k^2&lt;2^{k+1}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Since <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k&gt;4\" data-display=\"false\"></span> then <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k^2&gt;4k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"k^2+4k&lt;2^{k+1},\\qquad k^2+2k+2k&lt;2^{k+1}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Since <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k&gt;4\" data-display=\"false\"></span> then <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"2k&gt;8\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"k^2+2k+8&lt;2^{k+1},\\qquad (k+1)^2+7&lt;2^{k+1}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>So it holds that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(k+1)^2&lt;2^{k+1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, which is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n^2&lt;2^n\" data-display=\"false\"></span> with <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> substituted in.</p>","<p>As the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=5\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, and if the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> then the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so the statement is true for all integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\ge5\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.50-q7","number":7,"question":"<p>It is given that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n^3&lt;3^n\" data-display=\"false\"></span> where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is a positive integer and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is the largest value of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\" data-display=\"false\"></span> for which the inequality does not hold true.</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>Find the value of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li><li><p>Show that it is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n&lt;a\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li><li><p>Prove, using mathematical induction, that for all <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n&gt;a\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n^3&lt;3^n\" data-display=\"false\"></span> holds true.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"3^3=27\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"3^3=27\" data-display=\"false\"></span> so it doesn’t hold when <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=3\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a=3\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p>When <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> then <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"1^3=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"3^1=3\" data-display=\"false\"></span> so true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. When <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=2\" data-display=\"false\"></span> then <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"2^3=8\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"3^2=9\" data-display=\"false\"></span> so true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=4\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"4^3=64\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"3^4=81\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and since <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"64&lt;81\" data-display=\"false\"></span> true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=4\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Assume true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k^3&lt;3^k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"3k^3&lt;3\\times3^k,\\qquad3k^3&lt;3^{k+1},\\qquad k^3+2k^3&lt;3^{k+1}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Since <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k&gt;3\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"2k^3&gt;6k^2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"k^3+6k^2&lt;3^{k+1},\\qquad k^3+3k^2+3k^2&lt;3^{k+1}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Since <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k&gt;3\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"3k^2&gt;9k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"k^3+3k^2+9k&lt;3^{k+1},\\qquad k^3+3k^2+3k+6k&lt;3^{k+1}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Since <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k&gt;3\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"6k&gt;18\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"k^3+3k^2+3k+18&lt;3^{k+1},\\qquad (k+1)^3+17&lt;3^{k+1},\\qquad (k+1)^3&lt;3^{k+1},\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>which is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n^3&lt;3^n\" data-display=\"false\"></span> with <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> substituted in.</p>","<p>True for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. As the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=4\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, and if the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> then the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so the statement is true for all integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\ge4\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.50-q8","number":8,"question":"<p>Use proof by induction to show that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n!&gt;2^n\" data-display=\"false\"></span> for all positive integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\" data-display=\"false\"></span> such that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\ge4\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","steps":["<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=4\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"4!=24\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"2^4=16\" data-display=\"false\"></span> since <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"24&gt;16\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=4\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Assume true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k!&gt;2^k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"(k+1)!=(k+1)k!.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Since <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k!&gt;2^k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(k+1)k!&gt;(k+1)2^k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Since <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k&gt;1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> then <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k+1&gt;2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(k+1)2^k&gt;2\\times2^k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"(k+1)!&gt;2^{k+1},\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>which is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n!&gt;2^n\" data-display=\"false\"></span> with <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> substituted in.</p>","<p>As the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=4\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, and if the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> then the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so the statement is true for all integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\ge4\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.50-q9","number":9,"question":"<p>Prove by induction, for all integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\ge5\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n!&gt;10n\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","steps":["<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=5\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"5!=120\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"10\\times5=50\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=5\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Assume true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k!&gt;10k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: Since <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k!&gt;10k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>,</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"(k+1)k!&gt;(k+1)10k,\\qquad(k+1)!&gt;10k^2+10k.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Since <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\\ge5\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"10k^2\\ge50k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"(k+1)!&gt;50k+10k&gt;10k+50k.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Since <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\\ge5\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"50k\\ge250\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"(k+1)!&gt;10k+250&gt;10k+10=10(k+1),\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>which is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n!&gt;10n\" data-display=\"false\"></span> with <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> substituted in.</p>","<p>As the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=5\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, and if the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> then the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so the statement is true for all integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\ge5\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.50-q10","number":10,"question":"<p>Prove by induction, for all integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\ge5\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"3^n&gt;(n+1)^3\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","steps":["<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=5\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"3^5=243\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(5+1)^3=216\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=5\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Assume true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"3^k&gt;(k+1)^3\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"3^{k+1}=3\\times3^k&gt;3(k+1)^3,\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>so</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"3^{k+1}&gt;3(k+1)^3=3(k^3+3k^2+3k+1)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=3k^3+9k^2+9k+3=k^3+2k^3+9k^2+9k+3.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Since <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k&gt;4\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"2k^3&gt;8k^2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"3^{k+1}&gt;k^3+8k^2+9k^2+9k+3=k^3+17k^2+9k+3\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=k^3+3k^2+14k^2+9k+3.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Since <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k&gt;4\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"14k^2&gt;56k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"3^{k+1}&gt;k^3+3k^2+56k+9k+3=k^3+3k^2+65k+3\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=k^3+3k^2+6k+59k+3.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Since <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k&gt;4\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"59k&gt;236\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"3^{k+1}&gt;k^3+3k^2+6k+236+3=k^3+3k^2+6k+239\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=k^3+3k^2+6k+8+231=(k+2)^3+231\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"&gt; (k+2)^3,\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>which is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"3^n&gt;(n+1)^3\" data-display=\"false\"></span> with <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> substituted in.</p>","<p>As the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=5\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, and if the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> then the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so the statement is true for all integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\ge5\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.50-q11","number":11,"question":"<p>Prove by induction that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n!&gt;n^2+n\" data-display=\"false\"></span> for all integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\ge4\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","steps":["<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=4\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"4!=24\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"4^2+4=20\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=4\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Assume true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k!&gt;k^2+k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: Since <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k!&gt;k^2+k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>,</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"(k+1)k!&gt;(k+1)(k^2+k),\\qquad(k+1)!&gt;k^3+2k^2+k.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Since <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\\ge4\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k^3\\ge4k^2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"(k+1)!&gt;4k^2+2k^2+k=k^2+5k^2+k.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Since <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\\ge4\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"5k^2\\ge20k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"(k+1)!&gt;k^2+20k+k=k^2+3k+18k.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Since <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\\ge4\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"18k\\ge72\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"(k+1)!&gt;k^2+3k+72&gt;k^2+3k+2\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=k^2+2k+1+k+1=(k+1)^2+(k+1),\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>which is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n!&gt;n^2+n\" data-display=\"false\"></span> with <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> substituted in.</p>","<p>As the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=4\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, and if the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> then the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so the statement is true for all integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\ge4\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.50-q12","number":12,"question":"<p>Using mathematical induction, prove that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"2&gt;\\left(1+\\frac1n\\right)^3\" data-display=\"false\"></span> for all integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\ge4\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","steps":["<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=4\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\left(1+\\frac14\\right)^3=\\frac{125}{64}&lt;2,\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>so true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=4\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Assume true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"2&gt;\\left(1+\\frac1k\\right)^3\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: Since <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac1{k+1}&lt;\\frac1k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, then <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"1+\\frac1k&gt;1+\\frac1{k+1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Since <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is positive,</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\left(1+\\frac1k\\right)^3&gt;\\left(1+\\frac1{k+1}\\right)^3.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>So</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"2&gt;\\left(1+\\frac1k\\right)^3&gt;\\left(1+\\frac1{k+1}\\right)^3,\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>therefore <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"2&gt;\\left(1+\\frac1{k+1}\\right)^3\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, which is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"2&gt;\\left(1+\\frac1n\\right)^3\" data-display=\"false\"></span> with <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> substituted in.</p>","<p>As the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=4\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, and if the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> then the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so the statement is true for all integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\ge4\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.50-q13","number":13,"question":"<p>For real number <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and integer number <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\" data-display=\"false\"></span> where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a&gt;-1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\ge2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, prove by mathematical induction that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(1+a)^n&gt;1+an\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","steps":["<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"(1+a)^2=1+2a+a^2\\Rightarrow(1+a)^2&gt;1+2a,\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>so true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Assume true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(1+a)^k&gt;1+ak\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"(1+a)^{k+1}=(1+a)(1+a)^k.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Since <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a&gt;-1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, multiply the assumption through by <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(1+a)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"(1+a)(1+a)^k&gt;(1+a)(1+ak)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"(1+a)^{k+1}&gt;1+a+ak+a^2k=1+a(k+1)+a^2k.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Since <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a^2k\\ge0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>,</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"(1+a)^{k+1}&gt;1+a(k+1),\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>which is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(1+a)^n&gt;1+an\" data-display=\"false\"></span> with <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> substituted in.</p>","<p>As the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, and if the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> then the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so the statement is true for all integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\ge1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.50-q14","number":14,"question":"<p>Prove by induction, for all integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\ge2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n!&lt;n^n\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","steps":["<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"2!=2\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"2^2=4\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Assume true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k!&lt;k^k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: Since <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k!&lt;k^k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>,</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"(k+1)k!&lt;(k+1)k^k,\\qquad(k+1)!&lt;(k+1)k^k.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Since <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(k+1)k^k&lt;(k+1)(k+1)^k=(k+1)^{k+1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>,</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"(k+1)!&lt;(k+1)^{k+1},\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>which is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n!&lt;n^n\" data-display=\"false\"></span> with <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> substituted in.</p>","<p>As the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, and if the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> then the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so the statement is true for all integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\ge2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.50-q15","number":15,"question":"<p>Given that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are non-singular square matrices of equal dimensions. Use proof by induction to show that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(ABA^{-1})^n=AB^nA^{-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> for all integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\ge1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","steps":["<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:<br>LHS: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"ABA^{-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and RHS: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"AB^1A^{-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> so true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Assume true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(ABA^{-1})^k=AB^kA^{-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"(ABA^{-1})^{k+1}=(ABA^{-1})^k(ABA^{-1})\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=AB^kA^{-1}(ABA^{-1})=AB^kBA^{-1}=AB^{k+1}A^{-1},\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>so true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>As the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, and if the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> then the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so the statement is true for all integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\ge1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.50-q16","number":16,"question":"<p>It is known that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is a square matrix such that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A^2=A\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Use proof by induction to show that for all positive integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"I+A+A^2+\\cdots+A^n=I+nA\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","steps":["<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:<br>LHS: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"I+A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and RHS: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"I+1A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> so true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Assume true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"I+A+A^2+\\cdots+A^k=I+kA\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"I+A+A^2+\\cdots+A^k+A^{k+1}=I+kA+A^{k+1}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>But since <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A^2=A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> then <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A^3=A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A^{k+1}=A\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"I+A+A^2+\\cdots+A^k+A^{k+1}=I+kA+A=I+(k+1)A,\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>which is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"I+nA\" data-display=\"false\"></span> with <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> substituted in.</p>","<p>As the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, and if the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> then the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so the statement is true for all integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\ge1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.50-q17","number":17,"question":"<p>It is known that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is a square matrix and a sequence of matrices is defined recursively as <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A_1=A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A_{n+1}=A\\times A_n\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Use proof by induction to show that for all positive integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\det(A_n)=(\\det(A))^n\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","steps":["<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:<br>LHS: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\det(A_1)=\\det(A)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>;<br>RHS: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(\\det(A))^1=\\det(A)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> so true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Assume true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\det(A_k)=(\\det(A))^k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\det(A_{k+1})=\\det(A\\times A_k)=\\det(A)\\det(A_k)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\det(A)(\\det(A))^k=(\\det(A))^{k+1},\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>so true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>As the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, and if the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> then the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so the statement is true for all integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\ge1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.50-q18","number":18,"question":"<p>Use proof by induction to show that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\frac{d^n}{dx^n}(x^a)=\\frac{a!}{(a-n)!}x^{a-n}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> for all integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\ge1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\le a\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","steps":["<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac{d}{dx}(x^a)=ax^{a-1},\\qquad \\frac{a!}{(a-1)!}x^{a-1}=\\frac{(a-1)!a}{(a-1)!}x^{a-1}=ax^{a-1},\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>so true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Assume true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\frac{d^k}{dx^k}(x^a)=\\frac{a!}{(a-k)!}x^{a-k}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac{d^{k+1}}{dx^{k+1}}(x^a)=\\frac{d}{dx}\\left(\\frac{d^k}{dx^k}(x^a)\\right)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\frac{d}{dx}\\left(\\frac{a!}{(a-k)!}x^{a-k}\\right)=\\frac{a!}{(a-k)!}(a-k)x^{a-k-1}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\frac{a!}{(a-k)(a-k-1)!}(a-k)x^{a-k-1}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\frac{a!}{(a-k-1)!}x^{a-k-1}=\\frac{a!}{(a-(k+1))!}x^{a-(k+1)},\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>which is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac{d^n}{dx^n}(x^a)=\\frac{a!}{(a-n)!}x^{a-n}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> with <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> substituted in.</p>","<p>As the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, and if the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> then the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so the statement is true for all integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\ge1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.50-q19","number":19,"question":"<p>Prove using mathematical induction that if there are <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\" data-display=\"false\"></span> lines in a plane, no two of which are parallel and no three meet at a point, then they divide the plane into <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\frac{n^2+n+2}{2}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> regions.</p>","steps":["<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac{0^2+0+2}{2}=1,\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>which means there is an undivided plane, so true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Assume true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: the plane is divided into <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac{k^2+k+2}{2}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> regions.</p>","<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:<br>Since no two lines are parallel and no three meet at one point, the new line intersects all the existing <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> lines at distinct points. These <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> lines divide the new line into <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> segments. Each segment adds one new region to the plane:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac{k^2+k+2}{2}+(k+1)=\\frac{k^2+k+2}{2}+\\frac{2(k+1)}2\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\frac{k^2+3k+4}{2}=\\frac{k^2+2k+1+k+1+2}{2}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\frac{(k+1)^2+(k+1)+2}{2}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>So this is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>As the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, and if the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> then the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so the statement is true for all integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\ge0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]}]